./ * HRC244DS - Add support for most of HNDIO from VM/ESA
./ *
./ * DMSNUC data area updates needed to support the HNDIO  
./ * macro. This update makes two changes to IOSECT:  
./ *
./ * -- Reflects the increased size of the User Interrupt
./ *    Table entries created from HNDINT and HNDIO 
./ *
./ * -- Adds a second 18-word save area reflecting the   
./ *    HNDIO specifications that call for the handler        
./ *    to be called with R13 pointing to a save area.
./ *
./ * PREREQUISITES:
./ * none
./ *
./ * HISTORY:
./ * 22-Mar-2026 WDENTON  Initial version for VM370CE V1 R1.2
./ *
./ I 00002000 $ 00002050
         LCLC  &NUC                                            HRC244DS 00002050
./ I 00006000 $ 00006100
&NUC     SETC  '&SYSECT'                                       HRC244DS 00006100
./ R 00015000 $ 00015010
         DC    A(DEVSIZE)     Length of each entry             HRC244DS 00015010
./ I 00028000 $ 00028100
*
IOSAVE2  DS    24F            User HNDIO handler savearea      HRC244DS 00028000
./ I 00029100 $ 00029110 10
         DEVSECT                                               HRC244DS 00029110
         AIF   ('&SECT' NE 'CSECT').MEND                       HRC244DS 00029120
&NUC     CSECT ,              Resume main CSECT                HRC244DS 00029130
.MEND    ANOP  ,                                               HRC244DS 00029140